{"name":"Vigilant","hex":"#81796f","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"vigilant","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Watchful, especially for danger or disorder; alert; wary.","In vigilance."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/vigilant"}],"entries":[{"title":"Vigilant (1794 Baltimore schooner)","blocks":[{"text":"Vigilant was a Baltimore schooner, possibly originally launched in 1794 as Nonsuch. She appeared in the Danish West Indies as Vigilant from 1824. She carried the mail and passenger traffic between St. Croix and St. Thomas in the 19th and the first decade of the 20th century. A storm sank Vigilant on 12 September 1928."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/Vigilant_capturing_a_Spanish_Pirate_by_Hostmark%2C_1800s.tif/lossy-page1-330px-Vigilant_capturing_a_Spanish_Pirate_by_Hostmark%2C_1800s.tif.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vigilant_(1794_Baltimore_schooner)"},{"title":"French submarine Le Vigilant","blocks":[{"text":"Le Vigilant is a Triomphant-class strategic nuclear submarine in service with the French Navy. It was launched in September 2003 and subsequently commissioned in November 2004."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/SNLE-NG.jpeg/330px-SNLE-NG.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/French_submarine_Le_Vigilant"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/Vigilant_capturing_a_Spanish_Pirate_by_Hostmark%2C_1800s.tif/lossy-page1-500px-Vigilant_capturing_a_Spanish_Pirate_by_Hostmark%2C_1800s.tif.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/Vigilant_capturing_a_Spanish_Pirate_by_Hostmark%2C_1800s.tif/lossy-page1-1280px-Vigilant_capturing_a_Spanish_Pirate_by_Hostmark%2C_